{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alix is \u200b\u200ba retro-RPG adventure game in pixel art. The story takes place on the island of Auralia, which lived in peace until the day Romain wakes up from a terrible nightmare. When he wakes up, his little sister has disappeared, as well as all the animals on the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will discover great quests, you will have to solve puzzles, defeat the monsters who invaded the island, use spells, gain XP, and travel along the multiple islands of the archipel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alix, be strong, your brother is coming!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3245530?t=1748806297","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3245530?t=1748806297","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245530/52b33656c1cb3c045d6e9a1364f4511c32ec77bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748806297","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245530/52b33656c1cb3c045d6e9a1364f4511c32ec77bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748806297","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3505750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alix is \u200b\u200ba retro-RPG adventure game in pixel art. The story takes place on the island of Auralia, which lived in peace until the day Romain wakes up from a terrible nightmare. When he wakes up, his little sister has disappeared, as well as all the animals on the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will discover great quests, you will have to solve puzzles, defeat the monsters who invaded the island, use spells, gain XP, and travel along the multiple islands of the archipel.<